# File: tests/features/add_greeting_has_colon_library_helper.feature
# Generated from: specs/120-add-greeting-has-colon-library-helper/requirements.md
Feature: Detect a colon in a completed greeting

  @SCN001
  Scenario: Detect literal colon
    Given the installed greeting library and a valid name containing a colon
    When greeting_has_colon is called with Ada:
    Then it returns True for the completed greeting Hello, Ada:

  @SCN002
  Scenario: Report no colon
    Given the installed greeting library and a valid name without a colon
    When greeting_has_colon is called with Ada
    Then it returns False for the completed greeting Hello, Ada

  @SCN003
  Scenario: Reject invalid names
    Given empty, whitespace-only, and non-string names
    When greeting_has_colon is called with each invalid name
    Then each call raises ValueError with message name must not be blank
